  "0990d883dc7b": "To provide data required for an informed decisiion about the introduction of population screening for ovarian cancer. This involves establishing the impact of screening on ovarian cancer mortality, determining the best screening strategy and assessing the physical and psychological morbidity and health economic implications of screening"
